title: date_rosinante_4_DATE3_SUCCESS
location: quarters
---

Of course you do. It seemed to be a really touchy subject for Rosinante.
{$name}: You didn't want to talk about it...
Rosinante smiles.
Rosinante: And you let me drop it. I wasn't ready to talk about it then, but...
Rosinante: You've been a really good company and—
He stops suddenly, clearing his throat.
Rosinante: You deserve to know.
{$name}: You don't have to tell me if you don't want to, Rosinante. But if you're sure, I'd love to hear it.
Rosinante nods, looking you in the eyes earnestly.
Rosinante: I know, I want to. Thank you.
You return his smile, giving him a second to gather himself enough to actually start explaining.
<<jump date_rosinante_4_LOCATION2>>
