---

::LOCATION1
Rosinante: Where I was born, it's—
Rosinante: It's true the place has everything you can think of and then *more* things you couldn't even imagine. It's... Grand. And beautiful. Also possibly the worst place in the world.
Rosinante: It's...
Rosinante: Well...
He takes a deep breath, looking away as if to avoid seeing your reaction.
Rosinante: I'm from Mariejois.
You blink once, twice, trying to process the information.
{$name}: Wait, hold on.
{$name}: Mariejois? As in *that* Mariejois?
Rosinante: The one and only...
{$name}: You were a slave?!
Rosinante chuckles humorlessly.
Rosinante: Sometimes, I wonder if that would have been better.
So, not a slave.
That only leaves...
{$name}: Rosinante, you're—
{$name}: Are you a Celestial Dragon?
He winces at the name, but nods.
